# Materials settings

option.NORMAL_MAPPING                  = Mapeo normal
option.NORMAL_MAPPING.comment          = Indica si se deben usar los mapas normales proporcionados por el paquete de recursos. Activa esto si estás usando un paquete de recursos "PBR"
option.SPECULAR_MAPPING                = Mapeo especular
option.SPECULAR_MAPPING.comment        = Indica si se deben usar los mapas especulares proporcionados por el paquete de recursos. Activa esto si estás usando un paquete de recursos "PBR"
option.POM                             = Parallax Occlusion Mapping
option.POM.comment = Enables parallax occlusion mapping — a high-quality technique that adds depth to block surfaces by offsetting texture coordinates. Significant performance impact on lower-end hardware.
option.POM_SHADOW                    = POM Self-Shadowing
option.POM_SLOPE_NORMALS               = Slope Normals
option.POM_SLOPE_NORMALS.comment       = Uses the POM height field gradient to add relief-aware surface normals to lighting. Disable to keep the underlying normal map unchanged.
option.POM_DEPTH_WRITE              = Depth Write
option.POM_DEPTH_WRITE.comment      = Writes POM relief into the depth buffer so sunlight, skylight and SSPT respect surface height. Disable for compatibility or speed.
option.POM_SHADOW.comment            = Adds self-shadowing inside the POM height field from the main light direction. Higher sample counts improve quality at a performance cost.
option.TEXTURE_FORMAT                  = Formato de textura
option.TEXTURE_FORMAT.comment          = El formato de textura utilizado por el paquete de recursos. La mayoría de los paquetes modernos usan lab_p_b_r, mientras que los diseñados para funcionar con SEUS pueden usar OldPBR.
option.HARDCODED_SPECULAR              = Especular codificado fijo
option.HARDCODED_SPECULAR.comment      = Reflejos especulares codificados fijo para algunos bloques (por ejemplo, metales)
option.HARDCODED_EMISSION              = Emisión codificada fija
option.HARDCODED_EMISSION.comment      = Emisión codificada fija para algunos bloques (por ejemplo, antorchas)
option.GLOBAL_EMISSION_CURVE=Emission Curve
option.GLOBAL_EMISSION_CURVE.comment=Reshapes emission response (1.0 = neutral). Lower lifts dim glow, higher crushes it toward bright cores.
option.GLOBAL_EMISSION_INTENSITY=Emission Intensity
option.GLOBAL_EMISSION_INTENSITY.comment=Overall emissive brightness after the curve is applied.
option.HARDCODED_SSS                   = SSS codificado fijo
option.HARDCODED_SSS.comment           = Dispersión subsuperficial codificada fija para algunos bloques (por ejemplo, hojas)
option.RAIN_PUDDLES                    = Charcos de lluvia
option.RAIN_PUDDLES.comment = Controls rain puddles on the ground while it's raining.
option.RAIN_PUDDLES_INTENSITY          = Intensidad de charcos
option.RAIN_PUDDLES_INTENSITY.comment = Controls rain puddles intensity.
