option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS_CONTRAST=Reflection Contrast
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS_CONTRAST.comment = Adjusts how strongly the moon phase affects reflection contrast at night.
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS_SATURATION=Reflection Saturation
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS_SATURATION.comment = Adjusts how strongly the moon phase affects reflection color saturation at night.
option.FOG_SMOOTHING=Fog Smoothing
option.FOG_SMOOTHING.comment = When enabled, smoothly blends fog between frames to reduce flickering. Small performance cost.
option.FOG_SMOOTHING_RADIUS=Fog Blur Radius
option.FOG_SMOOTHING_RADIUS.comment = Adjusts the spatial blur radius for fog smoothing. Higher = softer, more blended fog at higher cost.
option.MATERIAL_MAPPING_MODE=Material Mapping Mode
option.MATERIAL_MAPPING_MODE.comment = Controls how PBR material textures (specular/normal maps via labPBR or OldSchoolPBR conventions) are decoded from resource packs. OFF disables, HARDCODED uses built-in per-block values, SPECULAR_ONLY reads just the specular map, NORMALS_ONLY reads just the normal map, SPECULAR_NORMALS reads both.
option.POROSITY_MODE=Porosity Mode
option.POROSITY_MODE.comment=Off disables wetness. Hardcoded uses built-in per-block porosity. Maps reads the labPBR specular B channel when a resource pack provides it, with no fallback on vanilla texels.
value.POROSITY_MODE.POROSITY_OFF=Off
value.POROSITY_MODE.POROSITY_HARDCODED=Hardcoded
value.POROSITY_MODE.POROSITY_MAPS=LabPBR
option.POROSITY_STRENGTH=Porosity Strength
option.POROSITY_STRENGTH.comment = Multiplier for the porosity darkening effect.
option.SSS_MODE=Subsurface Scattering Mode
option.SSS_MODE.comment=Off disables SSS. Hardcoded uses built-in scattering profiles for leaves and plants. Maps reads the labPBR specular B channel when a resource pack provides it, with no fallback on vanilla texels. Sheen follows the map automatically.
value.SSS_MODE.SSS_OFF=Off
value.SSS_MODE.SSS_HARDCODED=Hardcoded
value.SSS_MODE.SSS_MAPS=LabPBR
option.SSS_SHEEN_INTENSITY=SSS Sheen Intensity
option.SSS_SHEEN_INTENSITY.comment = Brightness multiplier for the subsurface sheen effect.
option.TAA_INTENSITY=TAA Strength
option.TAA_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the blend weight of temporal anti-aliasing. Higher = smoother image with less flicker but more ghosting on moving objects.
option.FXAA_INTENSITY=FXAA Strength
option.FXAA_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the strength of fast approximate anti-aliasing. Higher = smoother edges but softer image.
option.WATER_WAVES_NOISE_STRENGTH=Water Waves Noise Strength
option.WATER_WAVES_NOISE_STRENGTH.comment = Controls water waves noise strength.
option.WATER_TEXTURE_INTENSITY=Water Texture Intensity
option.WATER_TEXTURE_INTENSITY.comment = Controls water texture intensity.
option.SNELLS_WINDOW_INTENSITY=Snell's Window Intensity
option.SNELLS_WINDOW_INTENSITY.comment = Controls snell's window intensity.
option.BIOME_WATER_COLOR_INTENSITY=Biome Water Color Intensity
option.BIOME_WATER_COLOR_INTENSITY.comment = Controls the biome water color intensity color channel.
option.BORDER_FOG_INTENSITY=Border Fog Intensity
option.BORDER_FOG_INTENSITY.comment = Controls border fog intensity.
option.CAVE_FOG_INTENSITY=Cave Fog Intensity
option.CAVE_FOG_INTENSITY.comment = Controls cave fog intensity.
option.DESERT_SANDSTORM_INTENSITY=Desert Sandstorm Intensity
option.DESERT_SANDSTORM_INTENSITY.comment = Controls desert sandstorm intensity.
option.RAINBOWS_INTENSITY=Rainbow Visibility
option.RAINBOWS_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the opacity and vividness of rainbows during/after rain. Higher = brighter, more saturated rainbow.
option.END_SUN_EFFECT_INTENSITY=End Sun Effect Intensity
option.END_SUN_EFFECT_INTENSITY.comment = Controls end sun effect intensity.
value.MATERIAL_MAPPING_MODE.MATERIAL_MAPPING_OFF=Off
